    LLM: 'Game: Baccarat à Deux Tableaux (Baccarat Banque). Type: Multi-Hand Banking. Rules: Banker vs 2 simultaneous Player hands. Agency: Choice to draw on 5. Scoring: Modulo 10. Win condition: Beat two tableaus.',
